# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository.
#
# This project is edited from both macOS and Windows through a synced folder,
# which was producing whole-file CRLF/LF diffs on every commit and burying the
# real changes. `eol=lf` also overrides a local core.autocrlf=true, so the
# working tree stays LF on Windows too — scripts/run.sh depends on that.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated; keep diffs out of review.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
